    "also": [],
    "consider": [
     "What did Paul’s chains do for others? What does he rejoice in, and what does he still call wrong?"
    ],
    "reflect": [
     "Where has fear kept you quiet? Who could stand beside you as you take the next small, truthful step?"
    ]
